# rpi_agents deploy — NOPASSWD sudoers drop-in for Wake-Up AI service user
#
# agent/power.py:resleep() runs `subprocess.run(["sudo", "halt"])` as the
# non-root service user.  Without this rule the Pi never re-halts after a
# wake cycle, defeating the power contract.
#
# install.sh resolves __HALT__ via `command -v halt` (Bookworm: /usr/sbin/halt)
# and substitutes __USER__ + __HALT__ before activating this file via visudo.
__USER__ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: __HALT__
